    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo 12 The Moorings is a beautifully styled 4 bedroom home with attic conversion nestled in the highly sought after Moorings enclave within Marina Village. This exceptional residence offers a rare opportunity to acquire a home where thoughtful design meets everyday comfort. Just moments from Greystones North Beach, Harbour and a pleasant stroll from the vibrant town, this property blends coastal living with modern interior style.\n\nFrom the moment you step inside, there is an immediate sense of warmth and individuality. The current owners have created a home rich in personality, where every detail has been meticulously thought out. Custom-made wall panelling features prominently throughout the home, adding texture, depth and that 'little bit extra'. These bespoke finishes, combined with carefully selected Colour Trend colours and materials, create an inviting and elegant space that sets this home apart.\n\nThe accommodation layout is both practical and flexible, offering bright, well-balanced spaces designed for modern life. At the heart of the home lies a stylish kitchen and dining area, perfect for entertaining, and has floor to ceiling sliding doors opening out onto the rear gardens. The living room provides a cosy retreat with a refined yet relaxed atmosphere. A guest wc and separate utility complete the accommodation downstairs. \n\nUpstairs the current owners have converted the fourth bedroom into a walk in wardrobe space, this could easily be changed back into a bedroom if needed. The other three bedrooms are spacious double rooms, all with fitted wardrobes and the main bedroom is en suite. The family bathroom is located on this level also.\n\nA standout feature of this property is the expertly converted attic space. Flooded with natural light from the 3 Velux rooflights, this versatile area is a fabulous spot to relax in and can be adapted effortlessly to the needs of its new owners. There is also ample eaves storage in this space.\n\nThe property benefits from a landscaped rear garden with granite patio area providing space for outdoor dining. Raised flowerbeds are filled with colourful plants and shrubs and artificial grass means this space is very easily maintained. A wooden shed provides outdoor storage. \n\nSituated in Marina Village, The Moorings is a highly desirable place to call home. Residents enjoy easy access to scenic coastal walks, Greystones Harbour, local cafés, shops, and excellent transport links including DART services.\n\nThis is more than just a property—it is a home that has been thoughtfully designed and lovingly maintained, offering both comfort and character in equal measure. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that it has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - \nLaminate flooring, custom made radiator cover and wall panelling.\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, recessed lighting, heated towel rail, large mirror inset, wc and whb.\n\nStorage Closet - \nAmple storage space.\n\nLiving Room - \nLaminate flooring, central light, custom made wall panelling, window to front, central light.\n\nOpen plan kitchen/dining - \nTiled floor, recessed lighting, sliding doors out to rear garden. Extensive range of contemporary kitchen units including large pantry cupboard, Quartz countertops and splashback. Siemens induction hob, integrated microwave, electric Siemens oven, integrated fridge freezer, Siemens dishwasher. Kitchen island with storage, 1½ stainless steel sink unit with jet tap.\n\nUtility Room - \nTiled floor, fitted units, space for washer and dryer.\n\nUpstairs - \nLanding with central light and hotpress.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble room with carpet flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes, wall panelling, box bay window overlooking front.\n\nEn suite - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, recessed lighting, large fitted mirror, wc, whb, enclosed shower with Mira shower.\n\nBathroom - \nTiled floor, part tiled walls, wc, whb, bath with shower attachment, recessed lighting, separate shower with Mira shower, heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nDouble room overlooking rear, carpet flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nDouble room overlooking rear, carpet flooring, central light, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nSingle room overlooking front, central light, fitted wardrobes, custom made drawers and hanging space.\n\nAttic Level - \nCarpet flooring, Velux rooflight, central light, eaves storage.\n\nAttic Space 1 - \nRecessed lighting, 2 Velux rooflights, carpet flooring, eaves storage.\n\nAttic Space 2 - \nCarpet flooring, recessed lighting. Perfect office space.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 4 Bed terraced home with landscaped rear garden just a stones throw from the north beach and harbour</li><li> Prime coastal location in Marina Village</li><li> 2 designated parking spaces</li><li> Bespoke custom made wall panelling</li><li> Accommodation of approx. 167.7 sq.m (including attic)</li><li> Cleverly designed converted attic space</li><li> Immaculately presented throughout</li><li> Large selection of primary and secondary schools close by</li><li> A2 Rated modern home built c.2017</li><li> Designer kitchen with Quartz island counters and Siemens appliances</li><li> Scandinavian timber windows, sleek bathroom fittings (Villeroy & Boch), and high-spec joinery throughout</li><li> A-rated energy efficiency, featuring heat recovery ventilation, high insulation, and A-rated heat pumps for sustainably low running costs.</li><li> Annual service charges of approx,. 900 to include bin collection.</li><li> Just over 1km or a 15 minute walk to Greystones dart station</li><li> Management company Cushman Wakefield</ul>"
      },
